      "body": "## Motivation\n\nAdd a DCO check so PRs report missing or malformed `Signed-off-by` trailers on every non-merge commit. The workflow follows [CubeSandbox's DCO workflow](https://github.com/TencentCloud/CubeSandbox/blob/master/.github/workflows/dco-check.yml).\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Run the check on PR open, synchronization, reopening, and edits, with read-only repository permissions and cancellation of superseded runs.\n- Check only commits introduced by the PR, skip merge commits, and parse Git trailers. Fail if the commit range cannot be resolved, and print sign-off repair instructions when needed.\n- Add a PR checklist reminder and document sign-off commands and maintainer setup. Bot-authored non-merge commits follow the same rule; the check validates trailer format, not signer identity.\n\nMaintainers must add `Developer Certificate of Origin` as a required status check after the workflow has run to make it a merge requirement.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Passed `actionlint .github/workflows/dco-check.yml` and `git diff --check origin/main...HEAD` after rebasing onto current `main`.\n- Passed 17 local real-Git fixture scenarios covering valid, missing, malformed, and body-only sign-offs; unsigned earlier commits; merge histories; and missing base/head objects.\n- Ran the workflow's check script against this PR's signed commit successfully.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nNot applicable: CI and contributor documentation only.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable: no inference runtime changes.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #41677770098](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41677770098)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41677770077](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41677770077)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start 